00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:19.620
Are you officially confirming it?

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:21.163
Are the rumors true?

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:22.833
- Is it true? - Do you acknowledge it?

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:26.210
Oh. It's Seong Huiju!

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:54.072
Prepare yourself to become the Grand Prince's wife.

00:01:57.075 --> 00:01:58.076
You will be up against…

00:02:01.747 --> 00:02:03.540
…the whole nation.

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:18.513
Before all that,

00:02:20.223 --> 00:02:21.558
shall we see what you can do?

00:02:28.523 --> 00:02:29.524
Well then,

00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:32.652
how about a generous donation to the Crown?

00:02:32.653 --> 00:02:33.945
Sway public opinion first.

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.282
The palace will remain silent.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:42.996
Hmm.

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:47.626
You had me worried for a second.

00:02:56.051 --> 00:02:57.468
Move faster already.

00:02:57.469 --> 00:03:00.096
GRAND PRINCE I-AN ENTERS PALACE WITH CEO SEONG HUIJU

00:03:00.097 --> 00:03:04.100
Today, I'm going to show you the trending "Seong Huiju makeup" tutorial,

00:03:04.101 --> 00:03:05.976
the look that stole Prince I-AN's heart.

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:11.607
"COMMONER" SEONG HUIJU ENTERS PALACE WHAT'S NEXT?

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:35.756
PERFECT CROWN

00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:39.511
EPISODE 3 :cue

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.061
Welcome, Your Royal Highness.

00:03:49.271 --> 00:03:51.064
Her Majesty is looking for you.

00:03:51.982 --> 00:03:54.483
- I will pay her a visit tomorrow. - Your Royal Highness.

00:03:54.484 --> 00:03:57.446
Her Majesty has even postponed her meal and is waiting.

00:03:58.488 --> 00:04:00.240
