00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:02.492
Perhaps you can see her now.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:08.164
Wait for me. I shall be back.

00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:11.543
By myself?

00:04:26.767 --> 00:04:27.768
Are you afraid?

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:29.936
No.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:33.273
Take a nap if you are tired.

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:35.609
Okay.

00:05:02.093 --> 00:05:04.095
He's even a good actor.

00:05:14.523 --> 00:05:17.983
NOT PRIVY TO CEO'S PRIVATE LIFE, A CAUSE FOR CELEBRATION IF TRUE

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:19.401
Your Majesty.

00:05:19.402 --> 00:05:21.070
Grand Prince I-AN has arrived.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.708
Is such a delay necessary?

00:05:34.876 --> 00:05:36.837
- I did not know you were looking for me. - Not that.

00:05:37.712 --> 00:05:40.172
I ask whether such a delay is necessary

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:43.885
before you offer an apology for causing such a scandal.

00:05:46.304 --> 00:05:47.305
I see.

00:05:48.557 --> 00:05:51.141
I hear you brought that maiden with you.

00:05:51.142 --> 00:05:53.061
I understand the need to align stories,

00:05:53.562 --> 00:05:56.106
but did you have to bring her all the way to the palace?

00:05:56.606 --> 00:05:58.191
Have you any intention

00:05:59.442 --> 00:06:00.986
of denying it?

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:04.531
It appears I do not.

00:06:06.116 --> 00:06:07.367
I plan to confirm

00:06:08.451 --> 00:06:11.705
both the tryst at the hotel and the possibility of marriage.

00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:16.459
Are you throwing a tantrum?

00:06:18.169 --> 00:06:19.588
Premarital pregnancy…

00:06:23.884 --> 00:06:25.176
You can rest assured

00:06:25.802 --> 00:06:27.512
that no such tantrum will be thrown.

00:06:38.899 --> 00:06:41.401
Your Royal Highness, Public Affairs has reached out.

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:43.236
What are you doing here?

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.864
- Pardon? - You should be guarding Anhwadang Hall.

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:48.450
To keep an eye on Seong Huiju.

00:06:49.367 --> 00:06:50.576
But…

00:06:50.577 --> 00:06:51.661
My apologies.

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:03.380
Seong Huiju.

00:07:03.381 --> 00:07:04.840
Oh. You're here.

00:07:04.841 --> 00:07:06.259
Uncle.

00:07:08.511 --> 00:07:10.220
See, I told you it'd be spicy.

00:07:10.221 --> 00:07:11.847
Have some water.

00:07:11.848 --> 00:07:12.891
I am fine.

00:07:21.691 --> 00:07:24.986
Your Majesty, what are you doing here at this late hour? :cue

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.821
He said he was having trouble sleeping--

00:07:27.822 --> 00:07:28.948
I did not ask you.

00:07:30.325 --> 00:07:32.452
I was having trouble sleeping.

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:40.418
So I came by.

00:07:40.919 --> 00:07:42.420
What does having trouble sleeping

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:45.423
have to do with this?

00:07:46.424 --> 00:07:50.095
She said a full belly would help me fall asleep.

00:08:01.106 --> 00:08:02.399
Come in, Court Lady Jung.

00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:12.200
Your Majesty.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.912
Shall I escort you to Queen Mother's quarters?

00:08:25.839 --> 00:08:28.007
You couldn't just let him finish it in peace?

00:08:32.387 --> 00:08:34.055
I mean, come on.

00:08:34.597 --> 00:08:37.308
A bowl of ramyeon wouldn't have taken that long to finish.

00:08:41.187 --> 00:08:42.689
And if he suffers indigestion?

00:08:43.523 --> 00:08:44.858
You would be wholly to blame.

00:08:45.692 --> 00:08:47.610
And if Queen Mother is angered?

00:08:48.194 --> 00:08:50.320
All that over a measly bowl of ramyeon?

00:08:50.321 --> 00:08:51.364
The Queen Mother…

00:08:53.658 --> 00:08:54.659
denied the request.

00:09:02.625 --> 00:09:03.626
Well…

00:09:04.127 --> 00:09:05.628
we expected as much.

00:09:06.212 --> 00:09:08.547
But you know, it still doesn't feel great.

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:10.257
Like I'm being bullied by my in-laws.

00:09:10.258 --> 00:09:12.093
Wait! Hold on a second.

00:09:12.927 --> 00:09:15.013
What will you do if my in-laws really bully me?

00:09:16.056 --> 00:09:18.932
I mean, just look at how things are unfolding already.

00:09:18.933 --> 00:09:22.061
Let's say the Queen Mother and I got into a fight.

00:09:22.062 --> 00:09:24.064
Would you take my side?

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:29.652
Why aren't you answering?

00:09:30.445 --> 00:09:32.654
Will you take their side and not mine

00:09:32.655 --> 00:09:34.199
because they're your family?

00:09:39.746 --> 00:09:40.872
I will take your side.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.381
I must appear

00:09:51.591 --> 00:09:52.884
insanely infatuated with you…

00:10:01.935 --> 00:10:03.645
…for people to believe

00:10:05.522 --> 00:10:07.148
this absurd marriage is genuine.

00:10:16.741 --> 00:10:17.908
No, Your Royal Highness.

00:10:17.909 --> 00:10:19.993
You cannot let her sleep in Anhwadang Hall.

00:10:19.994 --> 00:10:21.995
We have no choice with the palace gates shut.

00:10:21.996 --> 00:10:24.164
We have the quarters of the palace attendants.

00:10:24.165 --> 00:10:25.667
But she is not a palace attendant.

00:10:26.709 --> 00:10:28.544
I shall look for other vacant quarters--

00:10:28.545 --> 00:10:29.628
No need.

00:10:29.629 --> 00:10:31.881
Get her a change of clothes as well.

00:10:33.049 --> 00:10:34.050
Clothes?

00:10:34.676 --> 00:10:35.802
Huh?

00:10:36.469 --> 00:10:39.472
Can I get something that's 100% cotton?

00:10:42.016 --> 00:10:44.144
My skin's a little sensitive.

00:10:50.984 --> 00:10:52.610
:cue

00:10:58.074 --> 00:10:59.868
Will you not even consider the sofa?

00:11:00.368 --> 00:11:03.079
No. This is perfectly fine.

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:10.043
The sofa would be perfectly fine too.

00:11:10.044 --> 00:11:13.506
Then you should go. That'd be perfect.

00:11:53.046 --> 00:11:54.047
Stop!

00:11:59.594 --> 00:12:00.845
My goodness.

00:12:06.476 --> 00:12:08.228
- Oh, my. -  Your Royal Highness.

00:12:09.479 --> 00:12:10.771
Your Royal Highness!

00:12:10.772 --> 00:12:12.023
Stay still!

00:12:15.568 --> 00:12:17.028
Your Royal Highness.

00:12:19.447 --> 00:12:21.532
-  Your Royal Highness! - What? Stay still…

00:12:23.451 --> 00:12:24.826
My goodness.

00:12:24.827 --> 00:12:26.829
Do you know what time it is right now?

00:12:27.538 --> 00:12:29.707
It's unlike you to sleep in like this.

00:12:35.088 --> 00:12:37.464
Ms. Seong is already on her way to work.

00:12:37.465 --> 00:12:39.092
With a pep in her step, at that.

00:12:59.237 --> 00:13:00.822
You didn't change?

00:13:01.406 --> 00:13:02.573
No. Something wrong?

00:13:09.998 --> 00:13:12.624
Are you trying to show off that you spent the night out?

00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:14.085
Did you not have time to change?

00:13:14.585 --> 00:13:17.005
I did have the time, but had no desire to.

00:13:17.672 --> 00:13:19.007
I wanted people to know

00:13:20.258 --> 00:13:21.509
I didn't go home last night.

00:13:22.969 --> 00:13:24.012
Oh.

00:13:38.568 --> 00:13:40.320
Are you quite pleased?

00:13:41.112 --> 00:13:44.614
Yes, I much prefer this over yakgwa.

00:13:48.494 --> 00:13:51.873
Did you sleep well last night?

00:13:58.212 --> 00:14:01.799
Did you dream about the late king again?

00:14:07.513 --> 00:14:08.514
Hmm.

00:14:23.738 --> 00:14:25.114
I am afraid.

00:14:27.742 --> 00:14:29.911
Do not worry, Your Highness the Crown Prince.

00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:33.747
- You will have me by your side-- -  You cannot, Your Royal Highness.

00:14:42.131 --> 00:14:43.132
Your Royal Highness.

00:14:44.092 --> 00:14:46.384
- The wedding rites are about to commence. - So?

00:14:46.385 --> 00:14:49.012
You should take your place out there.

00:14:52.558 --> 00:14:54.560
Should His Majesty learn of this…

00:14:58.314 --> 00:15:01.525
you will be punished for dishonoring the Crown Prince.

00:15:01.526 --> 00:15:03.236
Are you prepared for that?

00:15:05.863 --> 00:15:06.864
Your Royal Highness!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.954
I clearly gave you a chance.

00:15:14.288 --> 00:15:15.832
Whatever happens from here on… :cue

00:15:18.251 --> 00:15:19.252
you will have to…

00:15:21.129 --> 00:15:22.380
deal with it yourself.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:29.428
I am scared.

00:15:32.473 --> 00:15:35.476
Ah. Do not worry, Your Majesty.

00:15:35.977 --> 00:15:40.106
You will always have your grandfather by your side.

00:15:43.025 --> 00:15:44.026
Go on.

00:15:56.956 --> 00:15:58.791
FAMILY APPRECIATION MONTH EVENT REPORT

00:16:20.521 --> 00:16:22.564
A ROYAL SCANDAL? SEONG HUIJU HIT THE JACKPOT…

00:16:23.733 --> 00:16:27.445
"A royal child out of wedlock? That's insane."

00:16:28.279 --> 00:16:30.531
That's right. It's totally insane.

00:16:31.866 --> 00:16:34.701
"Prince I-AN and Seong Huiju make a terrible couple."

00:16:34.702 --> 00:16:37.205
No, we totally make the hottest couple.

00:16:38.831 --> 00:16:40.790
Can you stop reading the comments?

00:16:40.791 --> 00:16:42.793
Why? I need to monitor the situation closely.

00:16:43.586 --> 00:16:46.004
"Guys, maybe she has something on him?

00:16:46.005 --> 00:16:48.924
Why else would he date a commoner?"

00:16:48.925 --> 00:16:50.675
Why do you think, loser?

00:16:50.676 --> 00:16:52.845
Because I'm worth dating. That's why.

00:16:53.512 --> 00:16:55.264
- You little… - Here.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:59.601
The top five trending keywords are all about you.

00:16:59.602 --> 00:17:01.979
Your hotel outfit is already sold out.

00:17:02.772 --> 00:17:03.773
Really?

00:17:05.524 --> 00:17:06.733
Call the PR team.

00:17:06.734 --> 00:17:08.777
The PR team? Why?

00:17:08.778 --> 00:17:09.779
Why else?

00:17:10.446 --> 00:17:13.449
It's time to take back the number-one spot in sales.

00:17:14.575 --> 00:17:16.535
How can you even think about that right now?

00:17:17.828 --> 00:17:19.287
It's marriage, not retirement.

00:17:23.668 --> 00:17:25.753
Oh. Jeongwoo?

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.421
Hello, sir.

00:17:28.172 --> 00:17:30.465
-  Isn't he so handsome? - Super handsome!

00:17:30.466 --> 00:17:33.176
This is my first time seeing Prime Minister Min in person.

00:17:33.177 --> 00:17:35.387
He looks like a total celebrity.

00:17:35.388 --> 00:17:37.180
Right. But what's he doing here?

00:17:37.181 --> 00:17:38.390
Maybe because of the scandal?

00:17:38.391 --> 00:17:40.851
- Oh! That must be-- - Why is no one working?

00:17:43.688 --> 00:17:46.148
You're really going to marry him?

00:17:46.899 --> 00:17:48.608
- Yeah. - His Royal Highness?

00:17:48.609 --> 00:17:50.110
Yeah.

00:17:50.111 --> 00:17:51.737
I thought you two had just met.

00:17:52.363 --> 00:17:53.905
Can't you just stick to dating?

00:17:53.906 --> 00:17:56.284
But I want to be with him all the time.

00:17:57.118 --> 00:17:59.787
-  Huiju… - I want to wake up next to him

00:18:00.413 --> 00:18:01.455
every day.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.209
I hear the royal family

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:08.629
wants to marry him off to someone else.

00:18:10.715 --> 00:18:14.051
That's why I have to marry him right now.

00:18:14.635 --> 00:18:16.053
While you're the Prime Minister.

00:18:21.267 --> 00:18:22.602
I need you to get

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.021
my marriage approved.

00:18:34.405 --> 00:18:37.325
We're planning to invite the top 300 patrons in the country.

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:40.161
-  What are the criteria? - Your Royal Highness.

00:18:54.717 --> 00:18:57.218
The Queen Mother has taken to her sickbed.

00:18:57.219 --> 00:18:58.595
All of a sudden?

00:18:58.596 --> 00:19:01.139
Perhaps it's a ploy to prevent an official statement.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:04.143
The palace cannot speak of celebrations while a royal elder lies ill.

00:19:11.317 --> 00:19:12.818
JUNIOR ALUM

00:19:14.028 --> 00:19:15.196
Understood. You may leave.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.328
Your Royal Highness!

00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:25.456
I hear you fine. Lower your voice.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:27.416
Did you read the article?

00:19:29.293 --> 00:19:30.670
Right before it was pulled.

00:19:31.462 --> 00:19:33.296
It was taken down at lightning speed.

00:19:33.297 --> 00:19:35.173
The Queen Mother has been very busy.

00:19:35.174 --> 00:19:37.258
I guess even nobles can move quickly

00:19:37.259 --> 00:19:38.636
when they want to.

00:19:39.679 --> 00:19:40.680
:cue

00:19:42.973 --> 00:19:43.974
Seong Huiju?

00:19:44.517 --> 00:19:45.518
Oh?

00:19:46.727 --> 00:19:48.061
You sly fox!

00:19:48.062 --> 00:19:50.022
You dare try to seduce His Royal Highness!

00:19:51.065 --> 00:19:52.692
- "Fox"? - Yeah, you fox!

00:19:53.442 --> 00:19:56.361
- Oh, my gosh! - Stay away from His Royal Highness!

00:19:56.362 --> 00:19:58.906
- Get lost! - Hey, good job.

00:20:00.825 --> 00:20:01.991
Seong Huiju?

00:20:01.992 --> 00:20:03.661
Should we? Should we not?

00:20:04.328 --> 00:20:05.495
Come here, you brats.

00:20:05.496 --> 00:20:08.290
- We could throw them all. - "Come here, you brats!"

00:20:10.418 --> 00:20:11.961
Get over here now!

00:20:27.727 --> 00:20:28.728
Your Royal Highness.

00:20:31.355 --> 00:20:32.647
What is all that?

00:20:32.648 --> 00:20:34.607
Is it not obvious? These are your duties.

00:20:34.608 --> 00:20:36.152
- All of it? - All of it.

00:20:38.195 --> 00:20:40.780
- That cannot be true. - It most certainly is.

00:20:40.781 --> 00:20:44.368
These are the duties you are to carry out on His Majesty's behalf.

00:20:45.035 --> 00:20:48.413
These are the Queen Mother's… Goodness. This stack is quite heavy.

00:20:48.414 --> 00:20:51.542
These are the Queen Mother's duties you are to carry out

00:20:52.251 --> 00:20:53.626
in her absence.

00:20:53.627 --> 00:20:56.338
And these are your duties that accumulated while you were away.

00:20:57.006 --> 00:20:58.798
- You got this. - Get out.

00:20:58.799 --> 00:21:00.092
Yes, sir.

00:21:00.676 --> 00:21:02.720
Let's go. Off we go.

00:21:06.849 --> 00:21:10.185
You little brats should be in school with your noses in books.

00:21:10.186 --> 00:21:11.687
Eyes down!

00:21:12.897 --> 00:21:15.565
Does Prince I-AN put food on your table?

00:21:15.566 --> 00:21:17.776
He may not feed us, but he gives us money.

00:21:17.777 --> 00:21:20.196
- Right. - We're royal scholarship students.

00:21:20.988 --> 00:21:23.031
That money was for your studies.

00:21:23.032 --> 00:21:26.160
Do you think he wanted you to spend that money buying eggs to throw?

00:21:26.827 --> 00:21:27.953
And you, Hyerin.

00:21:28.496 --> 00:21:30.789
Why did you assume I seduced him?

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:31.873
Isn't it obvious?

00:21:31.874 --> 00:21:33.166
Why, you little…

00:21:33.167 --> 00:21:36.002
So young and already full of prejudice.

00:21:36.003 --> 00:21:37.880
If I had it my way,

00:21:38.631 --> 00:21:42.468
I'd give you hell and take legal action for pulling something like this…

00:21:44.011 --> 00:21:45.179
Come here.

00:21:46.305 --> 00:21:47.556
But right now,

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:50.559
your big sis here has a major undertaking ahead of her.

00:21:51.227 --> 00:21:53.354
So I'll let it slide just this once.

00:21:54.063 --> 00:21:55.064
Got it?

00:21:56.565 --> 00:21:58.400
- Answer me! - Yes, ma'am!

00:22:01.987 --> 00:22:03.446
Off you go.

00:22:03.447 --> 00:22:04.824
Almighty God.

00:22:05.991 --> 00:22:08.160
Please have mercy on us,

00:22:09.161 --> 00:22:10.788
forgive us our sins,

00:22:11.872 --> 00:22:15.543
and bring us to everlasting life.

00:22:17.044 --> 00:22:18.045
Amen.

00:22:21.841 --> 00:22:23.092
Amen.

00:22:25.302 --> 00:22:27.388
You said you couldn't come for a while.

00:22:28.681 --> 00:22:31.809
I heard my friend is getting married, so I came to pray.

00:22:33.143 --> 00:22:36.438
That friend is very lucky to have you praying for her happiness.

00:22:37.022 --> 00:22:38.023
I'm not so sure.

00:22:38.983 --> 00:22:40.317
I prayed for something sinful.

00:22:41.819 --> 00:22:42.987
Something sinful?

00:22:44.905 --> 00:22:46.115
I do not feel inclined

00:22:47.032 --> 00:22:48.367
to congratulate her.

00:23:01.255 --> 00:23:03.924
But I don't want to stop her either.

00:23:10.097 --> 00:23:11.640
Even if I don't think it's right…

00:23:12.558 --> 00:23:14.058
Damn it.

00:23:14.059 --> 00:23:16.228
Where did that punk hide it?

00:23:16.812 --> 00:23:18.522
If that's what she wants…

00:23:20.441 --> 00:23:22.358
- Ma'am. -  Hey, Jeongwoo.

00:23:22.359 --> 00:23:23.818
Are you running an errand?

00:23:23.819 --> 00:23:26.404
Yes.

00:23:26.405 --> 00:23:28.406
Principal Kim was looking for you earlier.

00:23:28.407 --> 00:23:29.658
Did you see him?

00:23:30.659 --> 00:23:31.869
…I have to let her.

00:23:32.578 --> 00:23:33.787
Found it.

00:23:36.498 --> 00:23:37.499
Got it.

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:52.473
:cue

00:24:04.526 --> 00:24:07.738
I mean, how did those brats even get past security?

00:24:08.656 --> 00:24:11.450
You have to hand it to the high schoolers in this country.

00:24:20.918 --> 00:24:21.919
Father?

00:24:34.098 --> 00:24:37.142
Can I get you anything?

00:24:40.187 --> 00:24:41.355
Don't bother. Sit.

00:24:50.239 --> 00:24:51.739
About that scandal…

00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:53.409
No need to explain.

00:24:54.868 --> 00:24:58.788
- You're not curious? - There's nothing to be curious about.

00:24:58.789 --> 00:24:59.790
I'm sure

00:25:00.290 --> 00:25:02.584
it's just a cheap stunt you pulled for attention.

00:25:05.379 --> 00:25:06.547
Then why are you here?

00:25:11.135 --> 00:25:12.136
It's nearly…

00:25:13.637 --> 00:25:15.180
Taeju's mother's death anniversary.

00:25:17.016 --> 00:25:18.934
I was wondering if you even remembered.

00:25:22.646 --> 00:25:23.647
Ma'am.

00:25:27.818 --> 00:25:30.029
She's been standing outside the house for hours,

00:25:30.654 --> 00:25:32.489
but she refuses to talk.

00:25:33.073 --> 00:25:36.076
Then you should've reported her to the police, not brought her inside.

00:25:36.702 --> 00:25:37.910
Send her away.

00:25:37.911 --> 00:25:40.831
How can we just send away a child in the middle of the night?

00:25:43.083 --> 00:25:45.669
Little one, are you lost?

00:25:48.213 --> 00:25:49.381
What's your name?

00:25:53.594 --> 00:25:55.012
You don't want to say?

00:25:58.348 --> 00:25:59.683
I am

00:26:00.267 --> 00:26:01.935
Lee Jooyeon's daughter.

00:26:07.566 --> 00:26:08.734
You're my dad…

00:26:09.651 --> 00:26:10.652
aren't you?

00:26:23.916 --> 00:26:25.792
- Honey! Honey! - Mom!

00:26:25.793 --> 00:26:28.127
- Ma'am! Wake up, ma'am! - Honey!

00:26:28.128 --> 00:26:30.422
- Honey! - Ma'am!

00:26:30.964 --> 00:26:33.216
- Ma'am! Oh, dear goodness! - Mom, wake up!

00:26:33.217 --> 00:26:35.802
Since the day your mother abandoned you…

00:26:35.803 --> 00:26:37.178
-  Ma'am. - Mommy!

00:26:37.179 --> 00:26:38.972
…our lives fell into despair.

00:26:46.980 --> 00:26:48.523
CERTIFICATE OF AWARD

00:26:48.524 --> 00:26:50.900
Buy me a bike too.

00:26:50.901 --> 00:26:53.570
The same one as Taeju.

00:26:56.198 --> 00:26:58.534
You dared to be greedy…

00:26:59.118 --> 00:27:00.327
REPORT CARD

00:27:01.328 --> 00:27:03.079
I want a building too.

00:27:03.080 --> 00:27:04.997
One that's taller than Taeju's.

00:27:04.998 --> 00:27:06.250
So greedy…

00:27:07.251 --> 00:27:08.334
STOCK PRICE ANALYSIS

00:27:08.335 --> 00:27:10.003
Amend your will, Father.

00:27:10.671 --> 00:27:12.004
In my favor.

00:27:12.005 --> 00:27:13.632
Your greed was relentless!

00:27:20.305 --> 00:27:22.139
Keep your hands off the company.

00:27:22.140 --> 00:27:23.266
And if I don't?

00:27:23.267 --> 00:27:24.976
I'll have no choice but to act.

00:27:26.812 --> 00:27:29.063
- What? Are you going to disown me? - Why not?

00:27:29.064 --> 00:27:30.356
Listen, Mr. Seong Hyeonguk.

00:27:30.357 --> 00:27:32.191
You dare call your father by his name?

00:27:32.192 --> 00:27:33.694
You just said you'd disown me.

00:27:34.528 --> 00:27:36.113
Then you wouldn't be my dad anyway.

00:27:37.614 --> 00:27:40.575
So, Mr. Seong Hyeonguk, to summarize,

00:27:40.576 --> 00:27:42.159
I shouldn't bother acting out

00:27:42.160 --> 00:27:45.163
because it'll all be Taeju's in the end, right?

00:27:45.664 --> 00:27:47.498
Seong Taeju will be the ultimate winner.

00:27:47.499 --> 00:27:49.543
Taeju is so awesome!

00:27:50.043 --> 00:27:51.253
That's the gist. :cue

00:27:51.920 --> 00:27:52.921
Right?

00:27:53.881 --> 00:27:56.883
I should just kill Taeju and secure my spot in hell.

00:27:56.884 --> 00:27:58.050
Seong Huiju!

00:27:58.051 --> 00:28:00.929
Anyone who ever tried to pick a fight with me was exactly like you.

00:28:01.722 --> 00:28:04.223
They'd stack the deck so they couldn't help but win,

00:28:04.224 --> 00:28:06.351
and put me in a spot where I was bound to lose.

00:28:08.103 --> 00:28:09.438
I guess they weren't confident

00:28:10.063 --> 00:28:11.523
they could win on equal terms.

00:28:16.153 --> 00:28:17.154
But you know what?

00:28:17.654 --> 00:28:18.989
It's fine.

00:28:19.615 --> 00:28:21.366
I'm used to going up against

00:28:22.451 --> 00:28:23.576
people like that.

00:28:23.577 --> 00:28:25.077
You just won't quit.

00:28:25.078 --> 00:28:26.079
I wish you…

00:28:26.955 --> 00:28:27.956
all the best.

00:28:29.374 --> 00:28:30.918
Though I'm sure you'll lose anyway.

00:29:07.579 --> 00:29:09.748
PRINCE

00:29:21.051 --> 00:29:22.677
Sorry for hanging up on you earlier--

00:29:22.678 --> 00:29:23.929
Are you okay?

00:29:27.432 --> 00:29:28.600
Are you all right?

00:29:32.104 --> 00:29:33.897
Seong Huiju, can you not hear me?

00:29:35.941 --> 00:29:37.776
Can I call you back tomorrow?

00:29:38.694 --> 00:29:39.695
What?

00:29:40.404 --> 00:29:41.738
I'm a little busy right now.

00:29:43.073 --> 00:29:44.157
I'll call you tomorrow.

00:29:59.881 --> 00:30:02.134
JUNIOR ALUM

00:30:43.508 --> 00:30:46.011
CERTIFICATE OF AWARD

00:30:59.107 --> 00:31:00.191
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, TAEJU

00:31:00.192 --> 00:31:01.818
HOPE YOU GROW UP STRONG AND HEALTHY

00:31:08.575 --> 00:31:10.577
Buy me a bike too.

00:31:11.578 --> 00:31:13.955
The same one as Taeju.

00:31:29.137 --> 00:31:30.597
REPORT CARD

00:31:37.312 --> 00:31:38.730
I want a building too.

00:31:39.648 --> 00:31:41.024
One that's taller than Taeju's. :cue

00:31:48.323 --> 00:31:49.991
Amend your will, Father.

00:31:50.575 --> 00:31:51.827
In my favor.

00:32:08.885 --> 00:32:09.970
Who is it?

00:32:13.849 --> 00:32:15.183
Someone lost their damn mind.

00:32:15.767 --> 00:32:17.310
Who the hell is it at this hour…

00:32:21.106 --> 00:32:22.274
Damn it.

00:32:31.074 --> 00:32:36.788
♪ Teatime for His Royal Highness! ♪

00:32:37.914 --> 00:32:38.915
Your Royal Highness?

00:32:39.624 --> 00:32:41.710
Wait, are we playing hide and seek?

00:32:43.712 --> 00:32:44.879
What are you doing here?

00:32:44.880 --> 00:32:46.714
Wait, are you allowed to be here?

00:32:46.715 --> 00:32:49.300
Hold on. Did anyone see you?

00:32:49.301 --> 00:32:50.427
Where's Aide Choi?

00:32:51.136 --> 00:32:52.304
You play baseball at home?

00:32:56.600 --> 00:33:00.270
I have one too many enemies, you see.

00:33:05.650 --> 00:33:06.734
Oh.

00:33:06.735 --> 00:33:07.736
Wait.

00:33:08.361 --> 00:33:11.280
How did you even get here?

00:33:11.281 --> 00:33:12.990
Wait, did you come here alone?

00:33:12.991 --> 00:33:13.992
Yeah.

00:33:15.118 --> 00:33:16.494
You can't just…

00:33:21.875 --> 00:33:23.084
Let me get this straight.

00:33:24.211 --> 00:33:25.962
You picked these up yourself?

00:33:37.933 --> 00:33:39.099
THE SEONG HUIJU COMBO

00:33:39.100 --> 00:33:40.310
I will have this one.

00:33:42.270 --> 00:33:43.897
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

00:33:45.106 --> 00:33:47.067
"Seduce the Prince" Seong Huiju Combo.

00:33:48.026 --> 00:33:49.027
It seemed popular.

00:34:11.716 --> 00:34:12.717
Seriously?

00:34:13.218 --> 00:34:16.221
Couldn't you have left after you finished your work?

00:34:25.605 --> 00:34:27.565
- What is it? - Just a bit amazed.

00:34:28.358 --> 00:34:29.484
By what?

00:34:30.277 --> 00:34:31.820
I came because you sounded so down.

00:34:32.612 --> 00:34:35.365
But seeing you eat, you seem perfectly fine.

00:34:41.162 --> 00:34:42.371
I was a little down.

00:34:42.372 --> 00:34:45.417
I was dragged through the mud all day, you see.

00:34:46.376 --> 00:34:49.044
I was barraged with hate comments on social media.

00:34:49.045 --> 00:34:51.630
My father suddenly threatened to disown me.

00:34:51.631 --> 00:34:52.632
Oh, that's right.

00:34:53.133 --> 00:34:56.719
I even got egged by your fans today.

00:34:56.720 --> 00:34:59.347
I totally forgot to ask if those eggs were antibiotic-free.

00:35:00.015 --> 00:35:01.265
You got "egged"?

00:35:01.266 --> 00:35:02.850
Yeah. Two eggs, no less.

00:35:02.851 --> 00:35:06.187
Those little pip-squeaks were so damn strong for no reason.

00:35:07.272 --> 00:35:08.772
- It still hurts. - Here?

00:35:08.773 --> 00:35:10.275
Yeah. Just downstairs.

00:35:12.027 --> 00:35:13.612
Are you hurt?

00:35:17.115 --> 00:35:18.158
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:35:19.117 --> 00:35:21.119
:cue

00:35:53.985 --> 00:35:55.403
An investigation is required.

00:36:00.617 --> 00:36:02.034
They're coming right now?

00:36:02.035 --> 00:36:03.620
That's what I said. Now, move it!

00:36:11.544 --> 00:36:13.546
She will be staying here for the time being.

00:36:20.470 --> 00:36:22.972
She has been receiving a troublesome amount of attention.

00:36:24.057 --> 00:36:25.350
I was concerned.

00:36:26.101 --> 00:36:27.227
So you were…

00:36:28.353 --> 00:36:29.938
concerned.

00:36:30.730 --> 00:36:31.897
And my instructions?

00:36:31.898 --> 00:36:34.150
Everything is ready, Your Royal Highness.

00:36:41.032 --> 00:36:42.033
Oh!

00:36:49.165 --> 00:36:50.750
Maybe that's a bit too close?

00:37:05.640 --> 00:37:07.559
Please make yourself at home.

00:37:09.018 --> 00:37:11.479
What should I call you?

00:37:12.272 --> 00:37:13.939
- Pardon? - How should I address you?

00:37:13.940 --> 00:37:15.775
Uh…

00:37:17.736 --> 00:37:20.946
I am Yeongmun of the Kim Family, the steward of this residence.

00:37:20.947 --> 00:37:23.825
Feel free to call me Steward Kim.

00:37:25.201 --> 00:37:27.078
Steward?  Hmm.

00:37:27.912 --> 00:37:28.913
Yes, ma'am.

00:37:29.622 --> 00:37:30.789
Steward.

00:37:32.667 --> 00:37:34.668
It's late, so I will leave you to rest.

00:37:34.669 --> 00:37:38.422
I will give you a proper tour of the property tomorrow.

00:37:38.423 --> 00:37:39.674
All right.

00:37:45.180 --> 00:37:46.306
Just a second.

00:37:47.640 --> 00:37:51.186
How shall I address you?

00:37:51.811 --> 00:37:53.188
Ah.

00:37:57.901 --> 00:38:01.862
I prefer Ms. Seong or Executive Director, but you can call me by my name.

00:38:01.863 --> 00:38:04.365
You're not my employee, after all.

00:38:07.160 --> 00:38:08.161
Then, I shall

00:38:09.162 --> 00:38:10.455
address you as Your Ladyship.

00:38:11.998 --> 00:38:13.666
"Your Ladyship"?

00:38:14.876 --> 00:38:16.044
Well then.

00:38:27.013 --> 00:38:28.889
I was at the palace yesterday,

00:38:28.890 --> 00:38:31.308
and today, the prince's private residence.

00:38:40.568 --> 00:38:41.820
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

00:38:42.403 --> 00:38:43.571
Do you like your room?

00:38:44.906 --> 00:38:45.907
I mean, it's nice.

00:38:46.407 --> 00:38:48.492
It feels like I'm on a historical drama set.

00:38:49.619 --> 00:38:51.287
Why aren't you sleeping?

00:38:51.830 --> 00:38:52.956
I have some work to do.

00:38:55.959 --> 00:38:57.210
Do you want me to help?

00:39:52.307 --> 00:39:54.893
So am I really going to live here now?

00:39:56.352 --> 00:39:58.104
Well, it's just that

00:39:58.646 --> 00:40:01.065
I'm quite an independent woman.

00:40:01.566 --> 00:40:03.401
I find this bustling environment…

00:40:04.319 --> 00:40:05.695
a bit bothersome, shall I say?

00:40:06.195 --> 00:40:07.739
It's so far from work too.

00:40:09.532 --> 00:40:11.117
Shouldn't you be more "bothered"

00:40:11.868 --> 00:40:15.370
if I were to leave you in harm's way when I'm supposedly infatuated with you?

00:40:15.371 --> 00:40:16.663
Commute aside.

00:40:16.664 --> 00:40:18.291
Okay.

00:40:21.878 --> 00:40:23.171
:cue

00:40:24.422 --> 00:40:25.465
By the way…

00:40:27.216 --> 00:40:28.592
You wanted to help.

00:40:28.593 --> 00:40:29.594
Is this you helping?

00:40:30.511 --> 00:40:32.889
I don't know anything about the royal ancestral rites.

00:40:33.389 --> 00:40:35.350
I've never even attended any of my family's.

00:40:43.942 --> 00:40:45.234
What do you want to know?

00:40:47.987 --> 00:40:49.237
Why are you marrying me?

00:40:50.698 --> 00:40:52.991
Isn't it a bit late to be asking that?

00:40:52.992 --> 00:40:55.577
We only made the decision yesterday.

00:40:55.578 --> 00:40:57.789
Why can't I be a little curious today?

00:40:59.707 --> 00:41:00.792
You have a lot of money.

00:41:01.459 --> 00:41:03.211
The richest in the country, no less.

00:41:05.546 --> 00:41:07.089
Is that your reason?

00:41:07.090 --> 00:41:08.507
The most important reason.

00:41:08.508 --> 00:41:11.176
It would help the royal family, always under fire

00:41:11.177 --> 00:41:13.178
for squandering taxpayers' money.

00:41:15.098 --> 00:41:16.891
And what a noble reason it is.

00:41:17.392 --> 00:41:18.893
Second.

00:41:21.896 --> 00:41:22.939
Beauty.

00:41:23.940 --> 00:41:24.983
"Beauty"?

00:41:25.566 --> 00:41:28.361
Oh, I guess that finally broke through.

00:41:30.405 --> 00:41:32.072
- Third. - What? What now?

00:41:32.073 --> 00:41:33.740
Because my family doesn't overstep?

00:41:33.741 --> 00:41:35.785
If I say I wish to ascend the throne,

00:41:37.996 --> 00:41:40.123
all would condemn me and hurl insults.

00:41:44.460 --> 00:41:45.461
But I believe

00:41:46.713 --> 00:41:47.922
you would understand me.

00:42:11.988 --> 00:42:14.406
The Inner Court Banquet is still some time away.

00:42:14.407 --> 00:42:17.242
Yet I am already being pressed to make a decision.

00:42:17.243 --> 00:42:19.286
It appears they are quite anxious,

00:42:19.287 --> 00:42:21.496
as they need to finalize the guest list soon.

00:42:21.497 --> 00:42:25.084
Does Your Majesty have any criteria in mind for the guest list?

00:42:25.668 --> 00:42:26.794
I'm not sure.

00:42:30.214 --> 00:42:33.426
Those with exemplary character, admirable talents,

00:42:34.969 --> 00:42:36.387
and innate nobility?

00:42:39.390 --> 00:42:41.183
Would that suffice?

00:42:51.402 --> 00:42:53.321
I must cancel today's itinerary.

00:42:54.155 --> 00:42:55.447
Pardon?

00:42:55.448 --> 00:42:56.656
But they already--

00:42:56.657 --> 00:42:58.076
Surely there should be no issue.

00:43:01.287 --> 00:43:02.997
I am indisposed, after all.

00:43:18.387 --> 00:43:20.264
Your Ladyship, please wake up.

00:43:25.311 --> 00:43:26.604
Your Ladyship, wake up.

00:43:28.272 --> 00:43:29.273
Wait, hold on.

00:43:31.025 --> 00:43:33.401
How dare you storm in here! Hey, you!

00:43:33.402 --> 00:43:34.569
Youngseon!

00:43:34.570 --> 00:43:36.948
Why that little prick…

00:43:39.117 --> 00:43:40.284
What in the world?

00:43:52.672 --> 00:43:53.755
What's this about?

00:43:53.756 --> 00:43:57.551
Cooperate with the Junghwajeon Hall fire investigation, please.

00:43:57.552 --> 00:43:58.970
"Cooperate"?

00:44:02.640 --> 00:44:04.016
At the Royal Birthday Banquet,

00:44:04.892 --> 00:44:07.645
you entered a restricted area of the palace, didn't you?

00:44:08.771 --> 00:44:10.731
I did get lost at one point.

00:44:11.649 --> 00:44:12.650
But what about it?

00:44:13.401 --> 00:44:15.778
Are you suggesting I started the fire or something?

00:44:16.362 --> 00:44:17.904
Nothing has been ruled out yet.

00:44:18.990 --> 00:44:22.618
You'll need to give a detailed account of what you did and who you met there.

00:44:23.369 --> 00:44:25.204
What exactly am I supposed to explain?

00:44:29.125 --> 00:44:30.750
What was that?

00:44:30.751 --> 00:44:31.752
You stay here.

00:44:32.503 --> 00:44:34.964
You've publicly stated, "The royal family is a money pit.

00:44:35.464 --> 00:44:38.593
Someone should abolish the Crown. Let's bring out the guillotine."

00:44:39.135 --> 00:44:40.136
Is that correct?

00:44:43.890 --> 00:44:44.973
Do you have a warrant?

00:44:47.185 --> 00:44:50.228
Under the Royalty and Specialist Protection Law,

00:44:50.229 --> 00:44:53.649
suspects of royal threats may be investigated prior to a warrant.

00:44:54.817 --> 00:44:55.860
Get started.

00:44:56.819 --> 00:44:58.613
Hold on. Take your shoes off.

00:44:59.780 --> 00:45:01.324
No, you can't take that!

00:45:07.496 --> 00:45:09.623
What do you think you're doing?

00:45:09.624 --> 00:45:11.666
- Hold on a second. - You can't take this!

00:45:11.667 --> 00:45:13.460
-  What are you doing? - Move!

00:45:13.461 --> 00:45:16.130
-  Is this really necessary? -  Please step aside.

00:45:17.590 --> 00:45:18.882
What are you doing?

00:45:18.883 --> 00:45:20.843
- This is insane. -  Why are you doing this? :cue

00:45:27.892 --> 00:45:29.142
Damn it. What now?

00:45:29.143 --> 00:45:30.936
Gosh, you're working so hard.

00:45:30.937 --> 00:45:32.103
Have you eaten yet?

00:45:32.104 --> 00:45:33.813
- You need to eat something. - I'm fine.

00:45:33.814 --> 00:45:35.565
Let's fill that belly first.

00:45:35.566 --> 00:45:39.194
This is His Royal Highness's favorite, so let's have a taste.

00:45:39.195 --> 00:45:40.654
Come on. Take a seat.

00:45:40.655 --> 00:45:43.699
Sit down. Let's have a bite while we chat.

00:45:44.200 --> 00:45:45.951
Go on. Just try one.

00:45:48.913 --> 00:45:52.123
Your Ladyship, you need to eat something too.

00:45:52.124 --> 00:45:54.000
Can't be questioned on an empty stomach.

00:45:54.001 --> 00:45:55.877
- Go on. It's still warm. - No thanks.

00:45:55.878 --> 00:45:57.088
- Come on! - Stop it.

00:45:57.672 --> 00:45:59.215
I'm calling His Royal Highness.

00:46:01.175 --> 00:46:02.677
Why isn't he picking up?

00:46:03.886 --> 00:46:05.137
He probably won't answer.

00:46:05.805 --> 00:46:06.888
What?

00:46:06.889 --> 00:46:09.308
Cell phones are not allowed during the ritual.

00:46:10.351 --> 00:46:11.352
Ritual?

00:46:11.978 --> 00:46:13.062
As in ancestral rites?

00:46:34.583 --> 00:46:36.668
Ms. Do. You're running, right?

00:46:36.669 --> 00:46:38.586
Yes, I'm running.

00:46:38.587 --> 00:46:40.505
What a hell of a way to spend the weekend.

00:46:40.506 --> 00:46:42.966
What choice do I have? You're the only one I can trust.

00:46:42.967 --> 00:46:44.384
Forget all that.

00:46:44.385 --> 00:46:46.095
Prepare to give me a hefty bonus.

00:46:46.679 --> 00:46:47.722
Hang up now.

00:46:50.182 --> 00:46:51.183
I got this.

00:46:53.060 --> 00:46:54.394
She won't get in.

00:46:54.395 --> 00:46:55.854
Why not?

00:46:55.855 --> 00:46:57.106
She's a civilian.

00:46:57.982 --> 00:47:00.901
Civilians may enter Jongmyo Shrine only on special days.

00:47:02.862 --> 00:47:03.863
Come on.

00:47:05.823 --> 00:47:08.033
Oh. Oh!

00:47:08.034 --> 00:47:09.576
Huh?

00:47:09.577 --> 00:47:11.746
ROYAL PROTECTION BRANCH

00:47:29.430 --> 00:47:30.431
Shall we?

00:47:42.151 --> 00:47:43.444
-  Hurry up, ma'am. - Hold on…

00:47:44.278 --> 00:47:46.197
My goodness.

00:47:47.156 --> 00:47:49.324
Wait. I can't believe this.

00:47:49.325 --> 00:47:51.368
- Please let me in this once. - No, you can't.

00:47:51.369 --> 00:47:53.203
I'm from Castle Beauty.

00:47:53.204 --> 00:47:54.913
I need to see His Royal Highness.

00:47:54.914 --> 00:47:55.998
We already told you no.

00:47:56.499 --> 00:47:57.874
Just leave already!

00:47:57.875 --> 00:47:59.585
How can I when I know he's in there?

00:48:04.131 --> 00:48:05.674
Ms. Do!

00:48:06.175 --> 00:48:08.803
Ms. Do!

00:48:09.387 --> 00:48:11.846
Ms. Do! Oh, Ms. Do!

00:48:11.847 --> 00:48:13.265
Ms. Do…

00:48:17.144 --> 00:48:18.895
We come by order of the Grand Prince.

00:48:18.896 --> 00:48:21.649
GRAND PRINCE I-AN

00:48:41.252 --> 00:48:42.253
Good heavens!

00:48:44.755 --> 00:48:45.922
That…

00:48:45.923 --> 00:48:47.882
Isn't that the Grand Prince's hopae?

00:48:47.883 --> 00:48:49.885
Why was that precious thing in the toilet?

00:48:51.512 --> 00:48:53.097
- Steward Kim. - Yes?

00:48:55.891 --> 00:48:57.268
Please take it to Jongmyo.

00:48:58.227 --> 00:49:00.479
- Pardon? - Just in case.

00:49:01.856 --> 00:49:02.898
I'm counting on you.

00:49:03.607 --> 00:49:04.608
You got this!

00:49:07.862 --> 00:49:08.863
Good luck!

00:49:10.239 --> 00:49:11.406
Good? Step aside.

00:49:11.407 --> 00:49:13.951
I knew it! You could've just let me pass earlier! :cue

00:49:20.666 --> 00:49:22.418
Where are you going? It's this way.

00:49:24.044 --> 00:49:25.921
That bonus better be a generous one.

00:49:26.672 --> 00:49:27.715
I'm so exhausted.

00:50:19.683 --> 00:50:22.227
Oh, dear. He can't step out while the ritual is underway.

00:50:22.228 --> 00:50:24.647
It's already started.

00:50:33.113 --> 00:50:34.156
Oh.

00:50:35.491 --> 00:50:37.618
- If he can't leave… - Yes?

00:50:38.118 --> 00:50:39.495
…we can go in instead.

00:50:40.788 --> 00:50:41.997
What?

00:50:54.218 --> 00:50:55.301
Huh?

00:50:55.302 --> 00:50:57.136
-  We need to go. - What?

00:50:57.137 --> 00:50:59.222
- We need to go. - Pardon?

00:50:59.223 --> 00:51:00.224
We need to go.

00:51:01.058 --> 00:51:02.977
- How did you even get in here? - Quiet…

00:51:04.979 --> 00:51:06.230
We need to go.

00:51:07.648 --> 00:51:09.191
We need to go right now.

00:51:13.988 --> 00:51:15.197
So…

00:51:16.448 --> 00:51:18.325
You're going to question me at the palace?

00:51:26.166 --> 00:51:27.375
Seong Huiju!

00:51:35.759 --> 00:51:37.136
Mr. Jung.

00:51:38.178 --> 00:51:39.430
Your Royal Highness.

00:51:40.806 --> 00:51:43.934
I heard the Royal Ancestral Rite was being held at Jongmyo Shrine today.

00:51:44.518 --> 00:51:46.937
- What brings you by? - His Majesty is presiding over it.

00:51:48.772 --> 00:51:50.524
But what business have you here?

00:51:51.900 --> 00:51:54.445
Without authorization from either His Majesty or me.

00:51:57.239 --> 00:51:58.782
I gave the authorization.

00:52:08.000 --> 00:52:11.128
As I heard the prime suspect in the arson case had been identified.

00:52:11.754 --> 00:52:12.755
And since she is…

00:52:15.007 --> 00:52:17.593
considered a flight risk and may destroy evidence.

00:52:19.595 --> 00:52:21.847
But I did not know that you would be here.

00:52:23.307 --> 00:52:24.683
Is there actually any evidence?

00:52:25.934 --> 00:52:28.395
As if insulting the Crown with such insolent attire

00:52:29.021 --> 00:52:31.732
and threatening others within the palace were not enough,

00:52:32.483 --> 00:52:33.525
I hear she was absent

00:52:34.818 --> 00:52:36.487
at the time of the incident.

00:52:37.154 --> 00:52:38.863
Does that constitute evidence?

00:52:38.864 --> 00:52:40.156
Perhaps not.

00:52:40.157 --> 00:52:42.743
But it should be enough to tarnish…

00:52:44.453 --> 00:52:45.871
her reputation

00:52:46.455 --> 00:52:48.290
or her company's reputation.

00:52:48.999 --> 00:52:50.167
Wait, my company?

00:52:53.754 --> 00:52:55.089
Then have me questioned too.

00:52:58.634 --> 00:53:01.136
Every circumstance that casts suspicion on her

00:53:02.304 --> 00:53:04.139
applies to me as well.

00:53:13.691 --> 00:53:15.359
Will your confidence hold?

00:53:17.444 --> 00:53:18.570
I wonder :cue

00:53:20.614 --> 00:53:21.865
if yours will hold.

00:53:36.338 --> 00:53:38.048
Ms. Seong!

00:53:41.885 --> 00:53:43.262
Oh, Your Royal Highness!

00:53:43.887 --> 00:53:45.139
- Summon a physician. - I-AN.

00:53:47.015 --> 00:53:49.518
Feel free to come to Anhwadang Hall for the questioning.

00:53:52.271 --> 00:53:54.272
Summon a physician!

00:53:54.273 --> 00:53:55.524
Hurry.

00:53:57.151 --> 00:53:58.527
Are you all right, Ms. Seong?

00:54:23.844 --> 00:54:24.845
Open your eyes.

00:54:28.015 --> 00:54:29.808
Wow.

00:54:30.768 --> 00:54:32.018
Wow, we totally slayed!

00:54:32.019 --> 00:54:33.102
Slayed, my foot.

00:54:34.438 --> 00:54:35.898
How could you agree to come here?

00:54:37.107 --> 00:54:39.984
That Mr. Jung or whatever practically dragged me out.

00:54:39.985 --> 00:54:40.986
How could I resist?

00:54:45.574 --> 00:54:46.575
So…

00:54:47.618 --> 00:54:49.244
will I be going to prison?

00:54:51.413 --> 00:54:52.497
Does that scare you?

00:54:53.916 --> 00:54:55.291
Me?

00:54:55.292 --> 00:54:57.418
I'm Seong Huiju of Castle Group.

00:54:57.419 --> 00:55:00.005
Prosecutor investigations and search-and-seizure raids…

00:55:00.506 --> 00:55:01.507
Stuff like that

00:55:02.090 --> 00:55:04.718
is practically an annual event.

00:55:06.178 --> 00:55:10.598
I was just wondering which law firm I should hire this time.

00:55:10.599 --> 00:55:12.726
- Is that something to be proud of? -  I mean,

00:55:13.393 --> 00:55:14.977
it's nothing to brag about, but--

00:55:14.978 --> 00:55:17.063
She won't be able to act for now.

00:55:17.064 --> 00:55:18.899
She knows pursuing you would implicate me,

00:55:19.399 --> 00:55:20.983
which would only escalate matters.

00:55:25.739 --> 00:55:29.201
But wouldn't you say that was quite a display?

00:55:29.785 --> 00:55:30.993
What was?

00:55:30.994 --> 00:55:32.120
Everyone saw it.

00:55:32.788 --> 00:55:35.958
The Queen Mother talked about tarnishing my reputation or whatever.

00:55:36.458 --> 00:55:38.209
And you taking my side.

00:55:40.963 --> 00:55:42.463
Wake up.

00:55:42.464 --> 00:55:44.299
Palace staff do not divulge palace affairs.

00:55:47.427 --> 00:55:48.971
Do you really believe that?

00:55:50.639 --> 00:55:54.058
They say the mouth is the gateway to disaster,

00:55:54.059 --> 00:55:56.853
and the tongue is a blade that cuts the body.

00:55:57.354 --> 00:55:59.606
Do you know how many mouths were there?

00:56:02.442 --> 00:56:07.239
And you think not a single mouth there has loose lips?

00:56:10.409 --> 00:56:14.496
They probably whipped up an entire soap opera out of it by now.

00:56:17.499 --> 00:56:18.916
I can't believe it.

00:56:18.917 --> 00:56:20.836
And still in his ceremonial robe?

00:56:21.503 --> 00:56:22.795
I mean, it makes sense.

00:56:22.796 --> 00:56:24.839
I heard from an attendant of the Queen Mother…

00:56:24.840 --> 00:56:26.757
I thought it was just a passing scandal,

00:56:26.758 --> 00:56:29.677
but as soon as she fainted, he swept her up in his arms.

00:56:29.678 --> 00:56:30.970
It caused quite a stir.

00:56:30.971 --> 00:56:32.763
It must be true love!

00:56:32.764 --> 00:56:34.098
I know, right?

00:56:34.099 --> 00:56:35.433
Hmm.

00:56:35.434 --> 00:56:37.226
Plenty of people weren't there.

00:56:37.227 --> 00:56:39.270
That doesn't make someone a suspect.

00:56:39.271 --> 00:56:41.231
She must've been so shocked that she fainted.

00:56:44.318 --> 00:56:46.736
Your Majesty, are you all right?

00:56:46.737 --> 00:56:49.238
Please stay there. I will clean this up.

00:56:49.239 --> 00:56:50.406
Court Lady Im.

00:56:50.407 --> 00:56:51.699
Is anyone out there?

00:56:51.700 --> 00:56:52.909
Court Lady Im!

00:56:57.039 --> 00:56:58.832
What are your thoughts?

00:56:59.625 --> 00:57:00.750
Pardon?

00:57:00.751 --> 00:57:02.002
About what, Your Majesty?

00:57:03.378 --> 00:57:05.546
The Grand Prince and that maiden.

00:57:05.547 --> 00:57:07.257
Did they seem

00:57:08.592 --> 00:57:10.093
genuine in your eyes as well? :cue

00:57:20.187 --> 00:57:22.313
- You're not coming with me? - I have to work.

00:57:22.314 --> 00:57:23.523
But it's the weekend.

00:57:24.066 --> 00:57:25.067
If I clock out,

00:57:26.193 --> 00:57:27.401
someone will kill me.

00:57:27.402 --> 00:57:28.737
Who?

00:57:30.614 --> 00:57:31.990
Him.

00:57:33.200 --> 00:57:35.327
Oh.

00:57:36.328 --> 00:57:38.080
Try not to stay up too late, though.

00:57:38.664 --> 00:57:39.830
I shall try.

00:57:39.831 --> 00:57:41.999
You can call me if you have trouble sleeping.

00:57:42.000 --> 00:57:43.377
I shall.

00:57:54.721 --> 00:57:56.306
The more mouths, the better, right?

00:58:47.065 --> 00:58:48.149
Your Ladyship!

00:58:51.945 --> 00:58:53.612
Are you all right?

00:58:53.613 --> 00:58:55.782
What about His Royal Highness? Is he all right?

00:58:57.075 --> 00:58:58.076
Well…

00:59:00.203 --> 00:59:02.246
Our dear Steward Kim played a huge role.

00:59:02.247 --> 00:59:04.623
I am quite a biker, you see.

00:59:04.624 --> 00:59:06.126
Thank you.

00:59:07.377 --> 00:59:08.502
Ha!

00:59:08.503 --> 00:59:09.670
Applause please.

00:59:12.424 --> 00:59:14.175
Well done!

00:59:14.176 --> 00:59:15.259
All right!

00:59:15.260 --> 00:59:16.303
I'm exhausted.

00:59:39.826 --> 00:59:41.036
Still alive?

00:59:41.661 --> 00:59:43.580
For now.

00:59:45.040 --> 00:59:47.541
I haven't been able to eat, so I'm starving.

00:59:47.542 --> 00:59:50.085
Why not? Is the food not to your liking?

00:59:50.086 --> 00:59:51.630
No, I'm just trying to lose weight.

00:59:52.130 --> 00:59:53.339
Why?

00:59:53.340 --> 00:59:55.424
Looking gaunt will make me seem more like a victim.

00:59:58.178 --> 01:00:00.263
You'll have the Royal Guard starting tomorrow.

01:00:00.889 --> 01:00:01.890
Really?

01:00:02.390 --> 01:00:04.391
Is that allowed when we're not married yet?

01:00:04.392 --> 01:00:05.684
It isn't.

01:00:05.685 --> 01:00:06.728
I see.

01:00:07.229 --> 01:00:09.856
"Another crazy stunt pulled by the infatuated Grand Prince"?

01:00:10.690 --> 01:00:12.650
I guess you can put it like that.

01:00:17.113 --> 01:00:18.490
Should I pull one too?

01:01:34.149 --> 01:01:36.400
Never thought I'd be doing this.

01:01:50.957 --> 01:01:54.794
This is the least we can do to make them think we're madly in love.

01:01:56.212 --> 01:01:57.255
Oh, right.

01:02:01.843 --> 01:02:02.844
Here.

01:02:04.137 --> 01:02:06.640
This is the tea I drink when I have trouble sleeping.

01:02:07.265 --> 01:02:09.225
It's really expensive, so don't waste it. :cue

01:02:10.936 --> 01:02:12.896
One more thing…

01:02:15.273 --> 01:02:18.360
This is the magnesium supplement I take when I really can't asleep.

01:02:19.235 --> 01:02:22.864
The side effect is nightmares, but it's better than not sleeping at all.

01:02:25.951 --> 01:02:27.827
- When did I ever ask-- - Stop that.

01:02:28.745 --> 01:02:31.164
You didn't see a doctor after what happened, did you?

01:02:35.752 --> 01:02:38.713
Don't you think I'd be quite the supportive wife?

01:02:40.298 --> 01:02:41.383
Hmm.

01:03:03.071 --> 01:03:04.155
What are you doing?

01:03:12.747 --> 01:03:13.748
Stay still.

01:03:53.163 --> 01:03:56.082
PERFECT CROWN

01:04:32.160 --> 01:04:34.036
Why would I blush

01:04:34.037 --> 01:04:36.955
and get all fluttery over a measly kiss?

01:04:36.956 --> 01:04:39.291
You should have maintained decorum.

01:04:39.292 --> 01:04:41.795
Then what? Should we make it a shotgun wedding?

01:04:43.004 --> 01:04:45.882
Can I take you somewhere? Let's speed things up a bit.

01:04:46.466 --> 01:04:49.094
The quicker we get married, the quicker we get divorced.

01:04:50.053 --> 01:04:51.136
Smile!

01:04:51.137 --> 01:04:53.890
Do you have that much time - to waste? - I don't.

01:04:54.516 --> 01:04:57.392
That maiden should move out of your private residence.

01:04:57.393 --> 01:05:00.230
Do you have a plan?

01:05:01.022 --> 01:05:02.397
Seong Huiju, what's wrong?

01:05:02.398 --> 01:05:05.275
Jeongwoo! The brakes aren't working!

01:05:11.032 --> 01:05:13.326
Why aren't you answering?

01:05:13.993 --> 01:05:16.370
Will you take their side and not mine

01:05:16.371 --> 01:05:18.413
because they're your family?

01:05:23.253 --> 01:05:24.420
I will take your side.

01:05:33.263 --> 01:05:34.347
I must appear

01:05:35.306 --> 01:05:36.850
insanely infatuated with you…

01:05:45.859 --> 01:05:47.235
…for people to believe

01:05:49.154 --> 01:05:50.738
this absurd marriage is genuine.

01:06:07.839 --> 01:06:09.841
- What's that? - It's my hopae.

01:06:10.842 --> 01:06:11.843
What about it?

01:06:13.261 --> 01:06:15.387
Use it when you need a title behind you

01:06:15.388 --> 01:06:16.514
or when you are afraid.

01:06:18.850 --> 01:06:21.811
Does it summon a dragon if I swing it around or something?

01:06:29.777 --> 01:06:30.778
It'll summon me.

01:06:42.040 --> 01:06:44.042
Translated by Justin S. Kim

01:06:55.345 --> 01:06:59.057
PERFECT CROWN

